erwards despatching a pointed arrow against [the Greeks] themselves, he smote them, and frequent funeral-piles of the dead were continually burning.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 REVIEW COMMENT}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \uc1 \u160 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5